      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By the seventh month the people of Israel were all settled in their towns. Then they all assembled in Jerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 27.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Joshua son of Jehozadak, his fellow-priests, and Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, together with his relatives, rebuilt the altar of the God of Israel, so that they could burn sacrifices on it according to the instructions written in the Law of Moses, the man of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.1+NUM.28.2+NUM.28.3+NUM.28.4+NUM.28.5+NUM.28.6+NUM.28.7+NUM.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 28.1–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even though",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Even though",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Because.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the returning exiles were afraid of the people who were living in the land, they rebuilt the altar where it had stood before. Then they began once again to burn on it the regular morning and evening sacrifices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 29.12–38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They celebrated the Festival of Shelters according to the regulations; each day they offered the sacrifices required for that day; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Num 28.11—29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and in addition they offered the regular sacrifices to be burnt whole and those to be offered at the New Moon Festival and at all the other regular assemblies at which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is worshipped, as well as all the offerings that were given to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " voluntarily. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Although the people had not yet started to rebuild the Temple, they began on the first day of the seventh month to burn sacrifices to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
